  "notes": "{混|こ}む is an intransitive verb (⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧) describing a crowded state.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: Intransitive (⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧)\n- No direct transitive pair\n- Pattern: [place]⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{混|こ}む\n\nASPECT (ている):\n- {混|こ}んで⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ = is crowded (state, not action)\n- This is one of the verbs where て⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ indicates a state result\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{電車|でんしゃ}→電車：00522_densha⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{混|こ}む (train is crowded)\n- ⟦{道|みち}→道：00505_michi⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{混|こ}む (road is congested)\n- ⟦{店|みせ}→店：00497_mise⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{混|こ}む (shop is crowded)\n\nCOMPOUND VERBS:\n- ⟦{込|こ}み{合|あ}う→込み合う：21395_komiau⟧ (to be packed together)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{空|す}く→すく：00756_suku⟧: to become empty (opposite)\n- ⟦{空|す}いている→すく：00756_suku⟧: not crowded (opposite state)",
